{"slug":"rodney-frelinghuysen","qid":"Q338190","name":"Rodney Frelinghuysen","desc":"American politician","article":"Rodney Frelinghuysen","born":"1946-04-29","died":null,"birthplace":"New York City","parties":["Republican Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"NJ-11","f":1995,"u":2019},{"t":"New Jersey General Assembly","w":"","f":1984,"u":1995}],"summary":"Rodney Procter Frelinghuysen ( FRAY-ling-hy-sən; born April 29, 1946) is an American former politician and lobbyist who served as the U.S. representative for New Jersey's 11th congressional district from 1995 to 2019. The district includes most of Morris County, an affluent suburban county west of New York City. A member of the Republican Party, Frelinghuysen served as chair of the House Appropriations Committee from 2017 to 2019.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":194299,"s":58.0,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":109455,"s":62.57,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":182237,"s":58.81,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":122149,"s":67.19,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":189696,"s":61.84,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":126085,"s":62.09,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":200915,"s":67.88,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":132938,"s":72.38,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":186140,"s":67.97,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":1998,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":100910,"s":67.74,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":169091,"s":66.27,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghuysen"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"NJ-11","p":"R","v":127868,"s":71.2,"w":true,"n":"Rodney P Frelinghu